import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 266 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Fierce-Realm Breakthrough Alternative: Full Opening of Origin Realm","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 266 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Fierce-Realm Breakthrough Alternative: Full Opening of Origin Realm","no":266,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Fierce-Realm Breakthrough","Origin Realm Full Opening","Realm Ladder","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview","23-20% Activation Strategy Plan"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0266_模块2-唐罗-凶境突破替代方案.md","filePath":"en/0266_模块2-唐罗-凶境突破替代方案.md"}'),a={name:"en/0266_模块2-唐罗-凶境突破替代方案.md"};function r(l,e,s,u,h,d){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-266-tang-luo-decomposition-fierce-realm-breakthrough-alternative-full-opening-of-origin-realm" tabindex="-1">Entry 266 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Fierce-Realm Breakthrough Alternative: Full Opening of Origin Realm <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-266-tang-luo-decomposition-fierce-realm-breakthrough-alternative-full-opening-of-origin-realm" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 266 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Fierce-Realm Breakthrough Alternative: Full Opening of Origin Realm&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 16)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-tear-down-the-ceiling-replace-it-with-an-infinite-ladder" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Tear down the ceiling, replace it with an infinite ladder <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-tear-down-the-ceiling-replace-it-with-an-infinite-ladder" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Tear down the ceiling, replace it with an infinite ladder&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the collective ascension axiom requires strong ones to lift Myriad Races forward together; the anti-predation axiom requires Great Dao public at all tiers. Tang Luo built the road up to fierce realm then capped it; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s alternative is to infinitely extend the ladder — Origin Realm fully open. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Fierce-realm capping&#39;s energy-level waste is already quantified in Entry 256; here focus on the alternative&#39;s energy release:</p><ul><li><strong>Genius liberation</strong>: geniuses originally internally friction-ing under the ceiling are redirected to new directions. The top-tier combat power released each generation is equivalent to producing dozens more top strong ones</li><li><strong>Resources redirected</strong>: resources originally used for zero-sum seat competition are redirected to incremental frontier expansion. Resource utilization switches from &quot;dividing the cake&quot; mode to &quot;baking the cake&quot; mode</li><li><strong>Hope regenerated</strong>: civilization again has a &quot;future,&quot; striving will rebounds. Hope itself is a kind of energy, and it is multiplicative</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste&#39;s reverse: <strong>once the capping tax is lifted, civilization energy does not grow linearly, but multiplies.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-capping-path" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Capping Path) <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression-capping-path" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression (Capping Path)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Not opening Origin Realm, regression path (echoing Entry 256): zero-sumization → solidification → despair transmission. Not repeated here; focus on the comparison after opening.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The predatory thinking behind capping (echoing Entry 256): nailing all beings&#39; future to one number is total-amount predation. Not repeated here; focus on how the alternative roots it out.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-origin-realm-fully-open" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative: Origin Realm Fully Open <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative-origin-realm-fully-open" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative: Origin Realm Fully Open&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Alternative complete design:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Module</th><th>Design</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Realm ladder</td><td>Nine realms fully open: Sense → Condensed → Transform → Law → Dao → Dao Integration → Boundary-Breaking → World-Creation → Origin; first five mortal cultivation, last four sacred cultivation</td></tr><tr><td>Origin system</td><td>300 Origin cultivation systems fully open, six categories of fifty each; Origin Three-Basic = deduction iteration (001) / life circulation (002) / space law jurisdiction scheduling (003)</td></tr><tr><td>20% Activation Strategy</td><td>Each generation sends 20% of strong ones upward, strong ones emerge in numbers rather than one person dominating</td></tr><tr><td>Multiplication Fruit</td><td>Hundredfold deduction amplification technicized, breakthrough speed exponentially rising</td></tr><tr><td>Infinite expandability</td><td>Above Origin can still incrementally connect Multiverse Realm, Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm (alias hyper-multiverse balanced-anchor realm), by law no apex</td></tr><tr><td>Alaya support</td><td>All breakthrough data uploaded; whoever hits a wall, the whole network helps find a door</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: not building the ceiling higher, but abolishing the concept of &quot;ceiling.&quot; The road has no end — this is legislation, not rhetoric.</p><p>It must be emphasized that &quot;Origin Realm fully open&quot; does not mean everyone can cultivate to Origin Realm. It only means — this road is public to all, no one is barred at the door. Whether one cultivates to it depends on personal talent, effort, opportunity, but &quot;whether one can walk this road&quot; itself is no longer decided by anyone. This is fundamentally different from Tang Luo clutching the ladder in his hand, only letting &quot;the selected&quot; climb. The former is equality of opportunity; the latter is selection bestowal. Heng Yuan Zhou does not want equality of outcome — outcome will never be equal — but equality of opportunity: 99% of beings are qualified to try, the cost of trying is backstopped by institutions.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate fierce-realm capping</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group B injects Origin Realm fully open + 20% Activation Strategy</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: number breaking through Origin Realm within a hundred years, genius mortality rate, total civilization energy</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B breakthrough number goes from 0 to batch, genius mortality drops 90%, civilization energy grows exponentially</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: high</strong>. The alternative directly interfaces with the official nine-realm system, self-consistent without contradiction</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: extremely low</strong>. Origin Realm fully open is a foundational setting, not stretching with plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: after the alternative, drops from &quot;high&quot; to &quot;extremely low&quot;</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: lift the capping tax, release multiplicative growth</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: cancel total-amount predation of all beings&#39; future</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo built the road to fierce realm; Heng Yuan Zhou builds the road to infinity</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Origin ladder is open to all Myriad Races as one</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: an infinite ladder naturally supports the hyper-multiverse</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-heng-yuan-zhou-verification-of-origin-realm-fully-open" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Heng Yuan Zhou Verification of Origin Realm Fully Open <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-heng-yuan-zhou-verification-of-origin-realm-fully-open" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Heng Yuan Zhou Verification of Origin Realm Fully Open&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fierce-realm breakthrough alternative&#39;s core is Origin Realm fully open. The Tang-Luo system locks Origin Realm in a few strong ones&#39; hands; Heng Yuan Zhou through the Alaya Network opens Origin Realm&#39;s law interface universally to Myriad Races. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization dares to fully open because the law-first axiom ensures Origin Realm admission does not depend on bloodline or bestowal, but on the cultivator&#39;s depth of understanding of the law network. The universal equal infinite law provides the origin basis for full opening: since every being inherently possesses basic infinite power, Origin Realm should not be a few&#39;s patent. After full opening, Tang-Luo-style fierce-realm ceilings are institutionally torn down.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Fierce realm is not cultivation&#39;s endpoint, it is Tang Luo&#39;s imagination&#39;s endpoint. The Origin-Realm-fully-open plan essentially turns &quot;breaking the upper limit&quot; from &quot;waiting for Tang Luo&#39;s mood&quot; to &quot;going by the law.&quot; Under the law, the road has no end.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · fierce-realm breakthrough alternative described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./14-修炼境界统一划分.html">14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification</a> · <a href="./10-三百套本源修炼体系总览.html">10-300 Origin Cultivation Systems Overview</a> · <a href="./23-20%激活战略规划.html">23-20% Activation Strategy Plan</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=i(a,[["render",r]]);export{c as __pageData,p as default};
